_meanings:
.²1 To go to, approach, resort to, have recourse to, approach for protection;
 {#yaM deSaM Srayate tameva kurute bAhupratApArjitam#} <ls>H. 1. 150</ls>; <ls>R. 3. 70</ls>, <ls n="R.">19. 1</ls>;
 {#SritAsi candanaBrAntyA durvipAkaM vizadrumam#} <ls>U. 1. 46</ls>.
.²2 To go or attain to, reach, undergo, assume (as a state); {#parItA rakzoBiH#}
 {#Srayati vivaSA kAmapi daSAm#} <ls>Bv. 1. 83</ls>; {#dvipendraBAvaM kalaBaH Srayanniva#} <ls>R. 3. 32</ls>.
.²3 To cling to, lean or rest on, depend on; {#nIlaH snigDaH Srayati SiKaraM#}
 {#nUtanastoyavAhaH#} <ls>U. 1. 33</ls>.
.²4 To dwell in, inhabit.
.²5 To honour, serve, worship.
.²6 To use, employ.
.²7 To devote oneself to, be attached to.
.²8 To assist, help.
